                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Wow! Momo's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Category creation via street food modernisation + 400+ outlet scale + multi-brand expansion + franchise + delivery mix. Multi-dimensional QSR advantage.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new momo / street food brands compete?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in regional / cuisine specialty. Regional momo variations, specific dietary focus (jain, vegan), premium positioning all coexist.</p>
                                        <h3>Is franchise a good QSR scaling strategy?</h3>
                                        <p>Capital-efficient scaling but requires operational discipline + brand standard maintenance. Not shortcut — requires investment in franchise support infrastructure.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest QSR / street-food lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Modernising informal categories creates branded opportunities. Multiple Indian street food categories still ripe for modernisation.</p>
